, September 8). BRONZE PRESIDENT Targets Government Officials. Retrieved September 9, 2025.", "source_name": "Sophos Mustang Panda PLUGX", "url": "https://www.secureworks.com/blog/bronze-president-targets-government-officials"}], "id": "relationship--4a5302f7-b953-4d4b-b080-6f3d5d4da00e", "modified": "2026-04-29T14:23:06.027Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "malware--64fa0de0-6240-41f4-8638-f4ca7ed528fd", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "attack-pattern--4933e63b-9b77-476e-ab29-761bc5b7d15a", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-17371', 0, 214, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', '3574BF691D91245D144192CDD890F42E414BD2852511415BBA4EF8B3F9CCC487', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
