. Retrieved September 9, 2025.", "source_name": "Google Threat Intelligence Group MUSTANG PANDA PLUGX August 2025", "url": "https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/prc-nexus-espionage-targets-diplomats"}, {"description": "Secureworks Counter Threat Unit Research Team. (2022, April 27). BRONZE PRESIDENT Targets Russian Speakers with Updated PlugX. Retrieved September 9, 2025.", "source_name": "Sophos PlugX September 2022", "url": "https://www.secureworks.com/blog/bronze-president-targets-russian-speakers-with-updated-plugx"}], "id": "relationship--79106ad4-28d3-4f67-a2c3-116d138ec84a", "modified": "2026-04-29T14:23:06.090Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "malware--64fa0de0-6240-41f4-8638-f4ca7ed528fd", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "attack-pattern--d1fcf083-a721-4223-aedf-bf8960798d62", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-17380', 0, 245, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', '58B928A7707EE8F002570AAB0BE74AB9F49FC25DA554570B5AED7944857A19E3', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
